<title>UK: Rugby league: Australian Aboriginals beat Britain 54-24.</title>
<headline>Rugby league: Australian Aboriginals beat Britain 54-24.</headline>
<dateline>WORKINGTON, England 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Aboriginals beat Britain 54-24 (halftime 20-6) in a rugby league match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Britain - Tries: Broadbent, Diskin, Jones, Mills; Goals - McGee (4)</p>
<p>Australian Aboriginals - Tries: Hookey (3), Anderson (2), Widders (2), Duncan, Mundine, Waters. Goals: Trindall (6), Waters.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
